5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! This is going to be so exciting! I wonder who the werewolf is? I'm going to find them for sure! Do you guys have any ideas on how we should start?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"Let's keep a level head, Rin. It's far too early to make accusations. I believe we should simply observe each other's behavior for now and see if anyone reveals themselves through their words.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with George. It's a bit scary to just start guessing. Maybe we should just... listen to each other for a while?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is wonderful to see everyone so spirited. Let's all be kind to one another as we talk. I think George and Daisuke have the right idea; let's get to know each other's thoughts first.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. Let's keep things peaceful and observant for now. Rin, your energy is lovely, but let's follow George's advice and listen carefully to each other. I'm looking forward to our discussion.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Okay! I'll try to be patient, but I'm still super curious! @George, you're always so calm. Do you think the werewolf will try to act like a villager, or will they try to lead us?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"They will likely do both, Rin. A clever werewolf will blend in as a villager while subtly steering the conversation to cast doubt on others. We must be wary of anyone who pushes too hard for a target.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"That... that makes sense. If someone is trying too hard to point fingers, it might be a trick. I'll try to pay attention, but I'm not very good at reading people...","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Do not be so hard on yourself, Daisuke. Your kindness and honesty are your strengths. We can all help each other find the truth, as long as we remain patient and supportive.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think Shizue is right. We can support each other through this. @Daisuke, don't worry about being perfect; just speaking your mind is helpful. Let's continue to observe and see if any contradictions arise.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I'll be watching super closely then! If anyone starts acting weird or pushing too hard, I'll be the first to notice! @Midori, do you think the werewolf is someone we'd never expect?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"It is quite possible, Rin. Often, the most unassuming person is the one hiding the darkest secret. We should not let our personal feelings or expectations blind us to the facts of the situation.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope it's not someone we trust. That would be... really sad. I'll try my best to watch, but I'm still a bit nervous. I hope we can all just get through this safely.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is only natural to feel nervous, dear Daisuke. We are all here for you. Let us hold onto that trust and use it to guide us toward the truth, with gentle hearts and clear minds.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Shizue. Trust is important, but we must balance it with a bit of caution. @Rin, to answer your question, yes, it could be anyone. Let's just keep talking and see how everyone feels.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'll be a super-detective and keep a sharp eye on everyone! Since we're just observing today, I'll spend the rest of the time thinking about who seems the most suspicious. Good luck to us all!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,"Good luck indeed, Rin. Let us all reflect on today's conversation. I shall be observing carefully as well, ensuring we do not let our guard down. I look forward to seeing what tomorrow brings.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll do my best too. Thank you for being so kind to me today. I hope tomorrow is a peaceful day for everyone... Good night.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Sleep well, everyone. May your dreams be peaceful and your hearts be light. I shall be thinking of you all. Good night, my dear friends.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. Let's all get some rest so we can think clearly tomorrow. I'll be reflecting on our talk as well. Sleep well, and I'll see you all in the morning.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Shizue,George,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""George""}"
