31,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning everyone! I hope you all slept well! I've been thinking all night... I wonder if the Seer found anything out? @Shizue, @Midori, @George, @Daisuke, does anyone feel suspicious yet?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Midori"",""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"It is far too early to cast suspicion, Rin. We have no new information yet. Let us wait and see if the Seer wishes to share anything, or if anyone's behavior has shifted since yesterday.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know. I'm still a bit scared. I haven't noticed anything strange yet, but... maybe the Seer knows something? I'm sorry, I'm not very helpful...","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Please do not apologize, Daisuke. You are doing just fine by being honest about your feelings. As for the truth, I have looked into the heart of one of our friends, and I am afraid I have found something very sad.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, what do you mean by something sad? Please, if you are the Seer, tell us what you found. We need to know the truth to protect each other. Who did you divine, and what was the result?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Wow, Shizue! You're the Seer! This is so exciting! Please tell us quickly! Who did you check, and are they the werewolf? I can't wait to hear!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"Let us maintain our composure, Rin. @Shizue, please share your findings with us. If you have identified the werewolf, it is imperative that we act on that information with caution and precision.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope it's not someone we like. But... we have to know. Please tell us, Shizue... who was it? I'm sorry for being so nervous, but I really want to know the truth.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a heavy burden to share, but for the safety of our village, I must be honest. I divined George, and I am heartbroken to tell you that he is the werewolf. Please, let us handle this with grace.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@George, I am truly shocked. Shizue is always so gentle and honest, so it's hard to believe, but we must trust her divination. George, do you have anything to say for yourself before we decide?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,"What?! George is the werewolf?! I can't believe it! You seemed so calm and reliable, George! Why would you do this to us? Are you really the bad guy? This is just like a movie!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"This is a most unfortunate misunderstanding. Shizue, I respect you deeply, but you must be mistaken. I am a simple villager. I urge you all not to let a single divination lead you to a hasty execution.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't want to believe it. George has been so helpful... but Shizue wouldn't lie to us, would she? I'm so confused. @George, if you're really a villager, how can you explain what Shizue saw?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a sorrowful thing to be in this position, but my vision was clear. I do not say this to be cruel, but to protect you all. Please, trust in my words, my dear friends.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@George, it's very difficult to ignore a direct result from the Seer. Shizue has no reason to lie to us. Unless someone else claims to be the Seer, I believe we have to trust her findings for the village's safety.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm with Shizue! She's too sweet to lie, and she said she saw it clearly! Sorry, George, but the super-detective says we have to trust the Seer! I'm voting for George!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,"I understand your trust in Shizue, but please, consider the possibility of a mistake or a deception. I am a villager. If you execute me now, you may be removing a loyal ally. I urge you to think carefully.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I really don't want to do this, but Shizue is always so kind and honest. I can't imagine her lying to us. I'm sorry, George... but I think I have to vote for you.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very heavy heart I carry today. I truly wish things were different, but we must do what is necessary to keep everyone safe. I forgive you, George, but I must stand by the truth.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I feel the same weight as Shizue. It's heartbreaking to vote against someone we respect, but the Seer's information is too critical to ignore. I'm sorry, George, but I must vote for you for the village's safety.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
